This is Dhammapada verse 144:

"Asso yathā bhadro kasāniviṭṭho, ātāpino saṃvegino bhavātha;
Saddhāya sīlena ca vīriyena ca, samādhinā dhammavinicchayena ca;
Sampannavijjācaraṇā patissatā, jahissatha dukkhamidaṃ anappakaṃ."

In the VRI edition, the verse reads:

"Asso yathā bhadro kasāniviṭṭho, ātāpino saṃvegino bhavātha;
Saddhāya sīlena ca vīriyena ca, samādhinā dhammavinicchayena ca;
Sampannavijjācaraṇā patissatā, jahissatha dukkhamidaṃ anappakaṃ."

The remaining words:

**vīriyena ca, samādhinā dhammavinicchayena ca; sampannavijjācaraṇā patissatā, jahissatha dukkhamidaṃ anappakaṃ.**
